cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "acomys-immunology: analysis code for a pre-registered comparative study of the CX3CL1-CX3CR1-CCR2-TGF-beta module in murid rodents"
message: If you use this software, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ahmad
    family-names: Hassanat
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9991-304X'
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline for a pre-registered, phylogeny-controlled comparative
  study of the CX3CL1-CX3CR1-CCR2-TGF-beta module across murid rodents,
  using public data only. Includes an alignment-free k-mer pipeline with a
  phylogenetic-residual endpoint, PAML branch-site selection analysis with
  multi-start fitting, species-native expression re-quantification, a
  sequence/expression convergence test, and a reading-frame integrity audit.
  Results and the associated manuscript are not yet released.
keywords:
  - Acomys
  - comparative genomics
  - pre-registration
  - alignment-free
  - dN/dS
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/ahmadhassant/acomys-immunology'
